# The generated Xcode project IS committed (Xcode Cloud clones only this repo and
# needs it, plus the xcodecloud/manifest.json workflow that lives inside it).
# Regenerate with ./gen.sh after any project.yml change, then commit the diff.
# Only per-user state is ignored:
LaReplique.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
LaReplique.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
# NB: xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved IS committed — Xcode Cloud refuses to
# resolve remote packages (Firebase, GoogleSignIn) without it.
LaReplique.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/configuration/

.build
DerivedData
dist
.DS_Store
*.xcuserstate
out
.build-ga
.build-signed/
